1085	# We currently do not restrict any style rules
1086	# as it slows down shipping code to Zed.
1087	#
1088	# Running ./script/clippy can take several minutes, and so it's
1089	# common to skip that step and let CI do it. Any unexpected failures
1090	# (which also take minutes to discover) thus require switching back
1091	# to an old branch, manual fixing, and re-pushing.
